description: Compiler source modules for parsing, Phase 2 analyses, AIR, and Wasm emission
includes:
  - crates/sigil-compiler/src/
excludes:
  - crates/sigil-compiler/target/
context: |
  This scope is the implementation-level view of the compiler crate.
  It is the right place for edits to AST design, parser behavior, diagnostics,
  ring/effect/taint analysis, AIR lowering, ownership/capability logic, or Wasm
  code generation.

  Keep pass ordering aligned with the current compiler pipeline:
  parse -> resolve -> type-check/monomorphize -> ring/effect/taint -> AIR ->
  cap/ownership -> memory -> fuel -> Wasm.

  Current hygiene expectations:
  - keep diagnostics source-located and readable from the CLI
  - keep control-flow lowering explicit at AIR boundaries rather than hiding it
    in Wasm emission
  - preserve crate-local ownership of language semantics; the CLI should stay thin
  - emit shared runtime metadata through `sigil-abi` rather than inventing
    compiler-private handoff types

  Current implemented slice:
  - `parser.rs` and `ast.rs` cover records, enums, arrays, references/slices,
    closures, ring/trust annotations, effect declarations, grants, declassify,
    region blocks, actor syntax, and typed FFI declarations
  - `type_check.rs` owns generic instantiation, actor/handler typing, closure
    capture analysis, effect-row resolution, taint annotations, extern FFI
    validation, and ToolForge entry-point checks
  - `ring_check.rs`, `effect_check.rs`, and `taint_check.rs` enforce the Phase 2
    security analyses after type checking
  - `air.rs` lowers into explicit blocks plus bump allocation, capability
    restrict/split, message serialize/deserialize, and runtime-call descriptors
  - `compiler.rs` orchestrates the passes and exposes both full-module compile
    paths and `compile_tool` / `compile_tool_with_limits`
  - `wasm.rs` emits either a full host-import module or a reduced outer-ring
    module and knows about `alloc`, `cap_restrict`, `cap_split`, and
    `fuel_exhausted` imports in addition to actor ops
related:
  - crates/sigil-abi/.scope
  - crates/sigil-compiler/.scope
  - crates/sigil-cli/.scope
tags:
  - compiler
  - src
  - parser
  - wasm
  - phase2
